    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "593ae463714e92b5fb180be48d44ae99",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"exercicio-3\">Exerc\u00edcio 3</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Considere o problema descrito no documento <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/zozzuriwaw7db9abpewyh/Logica-Computacional-Multiplicacao-de-Inteiros.paper?rlkey=j92tgvb8emq3ybb0aiv8jz33q&amp;dl=0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">+L\u00f3gica Computacional: Multiplica\u00e7\u00e3o de Inteiros</a> . Nesse documento usa-se um \u201cControl Flow Automaton\u201d como  modelo do programa imperativo que calcula a multiplica\u00e7\u00e3o de  inteiros positivos representados por vetores de bits.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"public/p.png\" /></span>\n<ul>\n<li>a.  Construir um SFOTS, usando BitVec\u2019s de tamanho <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n||)</marimo-tex> , que descreva o comportamento deste aut\u00f3mato; para isso identifique e codifique em <code>Z3</code> , as vari\u00e1veis do modelo, o estado inicial , a rela\u00e7\u00e3o de transi\u00e7\u00e3o e o estado de erro.</li>\n<li>b. Usando <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k||)</marimo-tex>-indu\u00e7\u00e3o verifique nesse SFOTS se a propriedade <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x \\times y + z = a \\times b||)</marimo-tex> \u00e9 um invariante do seu comportamento.</li>\n<li>c. Usando <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k||)</marimo-tex>-indu\u00e7\u00e3o no SFOTS acima e adicionando ao estado inicial  a condi\u00e7\u00e3o  <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(a &lt; 2^{n/2} \\land b &lt; 2^{n/2}||)</marimo-tex>, verifique a seguran\u00e7a do programa; nomeadamente  prove que, com tal estado inicial, o estado de erro nunca \u00e9 acess\u00edvel.</li>\n<li>d. Codifique a propriedade de anima\u00e7\u00e3o que exprime que o programa termina quaisquer que sejam os valores iniciais de <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(a||)</marimo-tex> e <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(b||)</marimo-tex> e prove que ela se verifica no SFOTS  que construiu.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "16c535a89d55390e286f60ed3faa3b83",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"estados\">Estados</h2>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span> <span class=\"ow\">and</span> <span class=\"n\">b</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">z</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">b</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"k\">while</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>   <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">even</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>       <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">z</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">z</span>\n     <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>       <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">z</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">z</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">stop</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">erro</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
